      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Donâ€™t Leave.</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After an unknown set of events, a majority of Bright Moon is made to believe that Catra, one of the Hordeâ€™s most important people, is dead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, however, Catra is clueless about all of this, off on an adventure that accidentally kick-starts her own redemption...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
